@baseUrl = http://localhost:5172

### Get all tasting signups
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/TastingSignups

### Get a tasting signup by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/TastingSignups/1

### Create a tasting signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/TastingSignups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tastingId": 5,
  "memberId": 1,
  "status": "confirmed",
  "signedUpAt": "2026-11-06T12:00:00Z"
}